            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method by a terminal in a wireless communication system is provided, the method comprising:receiving, from a base station, a system information block including mobility state parameters;identifying a first mobility state of the terminal based on the mobility state parameters;transmitting, to the base station, a radio resource control (RRC) setup complete message including the first mobility state of the terminal;receiving, from the base station, a first control message requesting a second mobility state of the terminal; andtransmitting, to the base station, a second control message including the second mobility state. Further, a terminal, a base station, and a method by a base station are also provided.</p>
            </abstract>
